                                        "text": "bool is_initialized = false;\nbool is_installed = false;\n\nfmp_header_image_info_t fmp_header_image_info[FWU_COMPONENT_NUMBER];\nstruct fwu_esrt_data_wrapper esrt;\n\n#define IMAGE_ACCEPTED          (1)"
