                            "end_col": 34,
                            "start_byte": 10192,
                            "end_byte": 10295,
                            "symbol": null,
                            "kind": "range",
                            "content_hash": "fbfdb666f3154613",
                            "confidence": "exact"
                        },
                        "metisTriaged": true,
                        "metisTriageStatus": "valid",
                        "metisTriageReason": "Verdict: the finding is supported because the per-component global FMP parsing counters are initialized only during bootloader init and are reused by load logic without reset in staging init or load error exits. Evidence: global state is declared at platform/ext/target/arm/corstone1000/bootloader/mcuboot/tfm_mcuboot_fwu.c:329, reset only by fmp_header_image_info_init at lines 1728-1734 and called from fwu_bootloader_init at lines 1834-1846, while staging init only erases staging at lines 1853-1882, load skips parsing when fmp_hdr_size_recvd is complete at lines 1961-1974, writes using image_size_recvd at lines 2123-2125, and increments it at line 2149. Gap: none.",
